From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Olivier=20Fl=C3=BCckiger?= <olivf@chromium.org>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 10:31:32 +0000
Subject: [icu] Fix signed int32_t overflow in CharString

Cherry-pick upstream ICU commit d37a22cb9921a76268e325fdca7d3e70a6851191
(https://github.com/unicode-org/icu/pull/4243) to check for signed
32-bit integer overflow when computing new capacities in CharString.

Bug: 565133743
Change-Id: Ife31d8e8d01fda0e410b5cdeb4ccac1192c870c1
Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/deps/icu/+/8579140
Reviewed-by: Koji Ishii <kojii@chromium.org>

